                            <h6 class="text-warning fw-bold">Day 2 Convective Risk</h6>
                            <p class="small text-muted mb-2">Tomorrow's risk area</p>
                            <img src="https://www.spc.noaa.gov/products/outlook/day2otlk_1730_cat.gif" class="img-fluid rounded border border-secondary chaser-img mb-2" onclick="openLightbox(this.src)" alt="Day 2 Outlook">
                            <a href="https://www.spc.noaa.gov/products/outlook/day2otlk.html" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm">Full Day 2 Discussion</a>
